message: "If you use this service, build on it or write about it, please credit it as below."
title: "Templated Data Service"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "aishwaryajayanth1820-git"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aishwaryajayanth1820-git/templated_data_service"
url: "https://aishwaryajayanth1820-git.github.io/templated_data_service/"
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-10-05"
abstract: >-
  Define a table, its UI, role permissions and actions in one JSON template, and
  the service creates the database table, a REST API and a React UI for it, with
  no code change and no restart. Spring Boot 4, Java 21, React and Mantine,
  SQLite, sandboxed GraalJS action scripts.
keywords:
  - template-driven
  - low-code
  - dynamic schema
  - schema migration
  - REST API
  - Spring Boot
  - React
